/Alt (A geometric diagram of a right-angled triangle to calculate tree height. Triangle A D E is above ground level 1 with Shorty's eye height at A, Lofty's head height at B, center at C, and top of the tree at D. H 3 equals h 1 plus d 1 plus d 2 multiplied by h 2 minus h 1 over d 1.)
